abstract: >-
  A source-free intrinsic boundary-germ reconstruction theorem for
  three-dimensional proper-zero reflected-cap data, a fixed-realization
  measure-zero exceptional-centre result, unconditional uniqueness for data
  with at most four hidden facets via a certified exchange bound, and exact
  rational replay artifacts including verified polynomial certificates.
